// "alphaGen oneMinusDot" and a "nextbundle" stage's own rgbGen on swamp2, from a
// script camera: the suck juice pool (textures/swamps/suckjuice) seen at a slant.
// Its last two stages move with alpha waves, so the two games' shots differ by
// the waves' phase.
probe:
waitforplayer
wait 2
spawn Camera targetname juicecam origin "-200 3472 800" angles "35 0 0"
wait .2
cuecamera $juicecam
wait 1
stuffcmd "screenshot"
wait 1
stuffcmd "quit"
end
